  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4846532f-570e-4623-b032-3c7f13d33efb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>**</h2>\n<p>使用此模組，您可以賦予龍噴火的技能，每種龍都有各自獨特的特性<br>**</p>\n<hr>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<p>預設情況下，它與來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Dragon Mounts : Legacy</strong></a> 的所有龍相容，以及我的擴充套件 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-more-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Dragon Mounts Legacy : More Dragons</strong></a>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fb498e82-05b9-4b35-a0dc-ef901ebc725b.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f5bf7c0e-fa99-43b8-9c12-71e7c9903b20.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_20f5f592-4534-4aa3-8570-c570b469e0ee.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>如果您為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dragon Mounts : Legacy</a> 安裝了擴充套件，您可以使用 **數據包 來添加您自己的龍息</p>\n<p>**您必須在路徑下建立一個名為 anyname.json 的檔案&nbsp;</p>\n<pre><code>data/yourdatatapackname/dragon_breaths</code></pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"dragon\": \"dragonmounts:forest\",\n  \"color1\": 1721356,\n  \"color2\": 1456650,\n  \"setOnFire\": false,<br>  \"range\": 25\n  \"breathEffects\": [\n    {\n      \"mobEffect\": \"minecraft:poison\",\n      \"duration\": 100,\n      \"amplifier\": 1\n    }\n  ]\n}</code></pre>\n<h4><strong>dragon</strong> - 必須是龍品種的 ID</h4>\n<h4><strong>color</strong> - 龍息顏色，地圖資訊顏色 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tydac.ch%252fcolor%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">您可以在這裡取得</a></h4>\n<h4><strong>setOnFire</strong> - 龍息是否會引燃目標</h4>\n<p><strong>range </strong>- 龍息作用範圍</p>\n<div>\n<h4><strong>breathEffects </strong>- 龍息附帶的藥水效果，可留空</h4>\n</div>\n<p>####</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_f464159c-1ee2-48bf-91b5-a1f406628200.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">我的其他模組&nbsp;</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-witcher-world-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1238/873/638810960517569231.png\" alt=\"《巫師世界》\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pirates-treasures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1031/133/638553772546353962.png\" alt=\"《海盜與寶藏》\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vitalcraft-skill-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1060/665/638592491337254994.png\" alt=\"VitalCraft：技能樹\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vitalcraft-runes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1075/81/638612119101538942.png\" alt=\"VitalCraft：符文\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-legacy-dragon-breaths\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1321/883/638859416236963261.png\" alt=\"Dragon Mounts Legacy：龍息\" width=\"129\" height=\"129\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-chimneys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1154/933/638722416788508737.png\" alt=\"Create：煙囪\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-remastered-more-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_f9c9d0fe-6f33-43fd-aab5-a7c630a57aea.png\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-more-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1154/935/638722417025475522.jpeg\" alt=\"Dragon Mounts Legacy：更多龍\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_ac376303-3148-4c79-8aed-7571077c0017.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
